                        "review": "Have the writers for this game ever spoken to another human being in their life? What the fuck were they thinking?? The skip dialogue feature is actually a god send. I hate all of the characters in this game expect from the guy with the glasses he was kind of cool. I wouldn't wish this game on my worst enemy. The only redeeming quality of it is that the art direction is pretty good and the comics were nice to see if you ignore the shitty dialogue. \n\nIf you like video games I BEG you to stay away from this one.\n\n4/10",
